lines+=['','## Evidence artifacts','','- `core/tests.py`, `core/test_mvp.py`, `core/test_acceptance.py`: automated behavior/security checks.','- `qa/acceptance-browser-results.json` and `qa/prototype-recording/FoodLoop-complete-prototype.webm`: isolated browser flow and local-offline proof.','- `qa/responsive-*-results.json`: layout/font checks across 11 widths.','- `qa/accessibility-performance-results.json`: automated axe checks, local navigation timings and PWA installability.','- `qa/production_smoke.py`: DEBUG-disabled page/static/security checks; production photo permission tests run through the normal suite.','- `docs/REMAINING_SIGNOFF.md`: external items that cannot be truthfully marked complete.','','## Business rules and workflows','','BR-001 to BR-015 are covered by authentication/verification/pathway guards, provider acknowledgement, donation-only listings, reservation bounds, deadlines, dual confirmations, terms/privacy, and immutable audit records. UC-01 to UC-07 are exercised by the request/listing/collection/moderation/report tests and recorded browser workflow. Open supervisory decisions are not counted as completed software features.','','## Scope boundary','','The implemented application covers the numbered functional requirements, including optional local capabilities for photos, profiles, configurable CO2 estimates and queued email. Payments, WhatsApp/SMS/USSD, AI matching, live maps, partial collection, nationwide deployment and native mobile apps are explicitly outside the SRS MVP. Section 17 future ideas remain a roadmap, not an unimplemented MVP requirement.']
